# Retire policy 2026-11-20: still in production in 2026 with no announced end; retire dates commented out. Revisit when an end is announced.
# Vauxhall Astra Mk8 (Astra L) five-door hatchback, 2021-present.
#
# 4,374 mm long, 1,860 mm wide, 1,441 mm high, 2,675 mm wheelbase; 1.2 petrol
# and 1.5 diesel, plus a plug-in hybrid. Stellantis platform.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Astra#Astra_L_(2021%E2%80%93present)
#
# Colours: Black, Star Silver, Flame Red and Metro Blue are period Vauxhall
# colours.
#
# Weight: 220 in total (silver 70, black 60, red 50, blue 40).
#
# Speed 220 km/h; comfort 130/525 (line). Class 1.
# Dates: 2021 to 2035, an estimate.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vauxhall-astra-mk8.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vauxhall-astra-mk8/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

